WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.580
The Sikh scripture opens
with two words: Ik Onkar.

2
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.300
There is one God.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.840
Sikhs call God Waheguru,
the Wonderful Lord,

4
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.690
and believe God's light is in every being.

5
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.960
So if God is that close, what
keeps people so far away?

6
00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:23.040
What if the biggest thing standing
between you and God is a single word: I?

7
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:28.120
In this mission, you'll meet five thieves
that Sikhs say rob a person of virtue.

8
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.790
Then you'll follow the
way Guru Nanak taught:

9
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.000
a life lived in the
world, not apart from it.

10
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:38.840
Your mission: find out what Sikhs
believe stands between a person and God.
